Total College Experience (TCE)
==============================

TCE is an unofficial mod of Venus University 0.2.0, made by CrazyyMister. It is not made,
supported or endorsed by Venus Dev. Problems with TCE go to TCE's own Issues, never to Venus
Dev.

  Original game:  Venus University by Venus Dev
                  https://venus-dev.itch.io/venus-university
                  https://github.com/venus-uni-dev/venus-university
  This mod:       https://github.com/CrazyyMister/total-college-experience

