Licence of the code
-------------------

The code is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 only
(AGPL-3.0-only); the text is in `LICENSE`. The original is under the same licence.

TCE modifies the original. It starts from commit b56a990 of the original developer's public
mirror (the game as of version 0.2.0, September 26, 2026), and the first change is dated
September 29, 2026. The complete record of what was changed, file by file and with its date,
is the Git history of the repository above, from that commit on.

The Corresponding Source of each TCE release is the repository above at that release's tag.
It includes the scripts that build the release.

