The game's music
----------------

TCE does not include the music of Venus University. The tracks are OpenTracks / DOVA-SYNDROME
downloads under their own licence and are credited in the game's Credits screen. If you have
the official game, `README.md` says how to copy its music into TCE.

Third parties
-------------

ComfyUI, its custom nodes and the image models are not distributed with TCE; they are fetched
from their own projects at setup, as in the original. They are credited in the game's Credits
screen with their licences.

Inspiration
